"lt.x.tlush":"Translation: “Dear employer, under the Wage Protection Law a payslip must be given to the employee by the 9th. Please provide my payslips for: {month}. Thank you for handling this promptly. Respectfully, {name}”",
"lt.x.pay":"Translation: “Dear employer, per my personal record I worked {hours} hours in {month}. By my calculation the salary paid does not match the hours worked (approx. gap: {diff} ₪). Please check the calculation and pay the difference with the next salary, per the Wage Protection Law and the Minimum Wage Law. I would appreciate a full hours breakdown in the payslip. Respectfully, {name}”",
"lt.x.pension":"Translation: “Dear employer, please provide confirmation of deposits (ishur afkadot) to my pension fund for recent months, per the mandatory-pension extension order. If there are gaps between payslip deductions and actual deposits — please settle them. Respectfully, {name}”",
"lt.x.delay":"Translation: “Dear employer, the salary for {month} has not yet been paid. Under the Wage Protection Law wages are due by the 9th; past that date this is halanat sachar entitling compensation. Please pay immediately. Respectfully, {name}”",
