"hol.mus.note":"A Muslim worker may take paid holiday days on the holidays of his religion (Eid al-Fitr, Eid al-Adha and others from the official state list) — or choose the Jewish holidays, but only one of the two. Dates follow the lunar calendar — agree in advance and notify the employer in writing.",
