"hol.rules":"<b>Working on a holiday</b> — 150% plus a day off in return.<br><b>Dmei hag</b>: hourly and daily workers with 3+ months of tenure get a non-working holiday paid — unless you skipped the day before or after without permission. A holiday falling on Shabbat gives no dmei hag. Monthly-salaried workers keep their full salary.<br>Non-Jewish workers choose: their own religion's holidays or the Jewish ones.",
