"tb.hint":"Tap «Clocked in» when the shift starts and «Clocked out» when it ends — or add days manually. Paid hours already have the 45-min lunch break deducted — when the shift is longer than the threshold and «must stay» is not ticked in the hours norm below; the deduction is shown right on the day row. The timesheet lives only on your device.",
